    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22584" root="شغل" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْغُولٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَغِلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ فَارِغٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْغُولٌ</span> <i>Such a one is devoted to that which is
unprofitable.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَارِيَةٌ مَشْغُولَةٌ</span> <i>A
young woman having a husband.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَالٌ مَشْغُولٌ</span> <i>Property devoted to commerce.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَارٌ مَشْغُولَةٌ</span> <i>A house in which are
inhabitants.</i> (TA.)

